/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 54 0 R
/E (With the increasing dependence on computer networks, cyberattacks targeting local network communication have become a serious concern. One such attack is the Address Resolution Protocol \(ARP\) Man-in-the-Middle \(MitM\) attack, where an attacker intercepts communication between devices and can monitor, alter, or steal sensitive data. Detecting such attacks in real time is challenging because malicious traffic may resemble normal network behavior. )
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [16]
>>
endobj
79 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 54 0 R
/E (This project focuses on analyzing network traffic and identifying abnormal behavior using the Kitsune anomaly detection framework. Raw packet capture data is processed, converted into structured features, and used to detect suspicious traffic patterns that may indicate an attack. )
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [17]
>>
endobj
